@startuml
title check@collect 组件架构
skinparam componentStyle uml2
component "响应式 Web 客户端\n四模块对应页面" as Client
rectangle "单个后端应用进程" {
  component "M1 用户与应用入口" as M1
  component "M2 POI 采集与地图" as M2
  component "M3 核验与异议处理" as M3
  component "M4 消息与交流" as M4
}
database "PostgreSQL\n各模块拥有自己的表" as DB
artifact "照片目录\nM2 管理" as Photos
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
cloud "外部平台" {
  component "微信授权" as WX
  component "地图服务" as Map
  component "OCR API" as OCR
}
Client ..> M1 : HTTPS 登录
Client ..> M2 : HTTPS 采集/地图
Client ..> M3 : HTTPS 核验/异议
Client ..> M4 : HTTPS 通知/聊天
M2 ..> M1 : 身份与角色
M3 ..> M1 : 身份与角色
M4 ..> M1 : 身份与角色
M3 ..> M2 : 版本与核验摘要
M2 ..> M4 : 新数据通知
M3 ..> M4 : 问题/任务/裁定通知
M1 ..> DB
M2 ..> DB
M3 ..> DB
M4 ..> DB
M2 ..> Photos
M4 ..> MQ : 发布/消费通知
M1 ..> WX
M2 ..> Map
M2 ..> OCR
@enduml
